      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry you're feeling this way. The state of the world can be overwhelming, but it's essential to remember that impactful change still happens from individual actions. You don’t have to confront it alone, and finding a close-knit community group or even small acts of kindness can help sustain hope. If these feelings persist, reaching out to a mental health professional might be beneficial. Your life and efforts do matter.",
